{"id":"d53b945955293235","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-numeral.md","title":"Numeral","display":"df-numeral — Numeral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-numeral","aliases":["90-df-numeral"],"display":"df-numeral — Numeral","depends_on":["[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-numeral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeral — Numeral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span> (zero constant and successor symbol, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (numeral term, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\vec n}\">\\(\\overline{\\vec n}\\)</span> 是下式定义的对象项有限列，不是元语言自然数列本身。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline 0\\coloneqq0,\n\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\overline n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline 0\\coloneqq0,\n\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\overline n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline{\\vec n}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\overline{n_i})_{i&lt;k}\\quad(\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\overline n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land\\operatorname{var}(\\overline n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline{\\vec n}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\overline{n_i})_{i&lt;k}\\quad(\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\overline n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land\\operatorname{var}(\\overline n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span> is the term in the formal language that represents the number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"5385f3fe07cb98ef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,S$ (zero constant and successor symbol, see [[90-df-arithmetic-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k$；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\operatorname{var}$ 取 [[90-df-free-variable]]。$\\overline{\\vec n}$ 是下式定义的对象项有限列，不是元语言自然数列本身。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"5385f3fe07cb98ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k$；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\operatorname{var}$ 取 [[90-df-free-variable]]。$\\overline{\\vec n}$ 是下式定义的对象项有限列，不是元语言自然数列本身。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"0,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\vec n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\overline 0\\coloneqq0,\n\\qquad\n\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\overline n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline{\\vec n}&\\coloneqq(\\overline{n_i})_{i<k}\\quad(\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k),\\\\\n&\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\overline n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land\\operatorname{var}(\\overline n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1226,"backlinks":[{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 取 [[90-df-godel-number]] 在当前同一 $g$ 下的角码记号；$\\overline n$ 取 [[90-df-numeral]] 的对象语言数码。"},{"id":"fac5c810f5035179","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"含 $\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T$、$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 或 $\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 的式子另固定 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 及 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一完整证明呈示，满足该文件关于签名、$g,d$、有效公理化、行验证器和所选证明公式的全部条件。数码和标准结构见 [[90-df-numeral]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。"},{"id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"adc0aa731119457e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-3","l